    description: "DEEP bakeoff cohort #20 (mastodon): 1830 routes correctly extracted from config/routes.rb but all are orphan nodes. Zero edges connect them to controller actions. Route nodes cannot participate in slicing. Mastodon orphan rate drops from 16.6% to 8.8% excluding route orphans. Need a Rails-specific linker mapping 'GET /accounts -> accounts#show' to AccountsController#show method symbol."  # d2e7
